  "solution": "The pattern followed here is:\n\nHere, interchange the mathematical signs to make the equation correct.\n\nGiven:- 20 ÷ 4 × 8 + 16 - 15 = 11\n\n**Option 1) **-, ÷\n\nAfter interchanging the sign we get the:\n\n⇒ 20 - 4 × 8 + __**16 ÷ 15**__ = 11\n\n⇒ 20 - __**4 × 8**__ + 1.066 = 11\n\n⇒ __**20 **__- 32 __**+ 1.066 **__= 11\n\n⇒ __**21.066 - 32**__ = 11\n\n⇒ - 10.934 ≠ 11\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option 2) **+, -\n\nAfter interchanging the sign we get the:\n\n⇒ __**20 ÷ 4 **__× 8 - 16 + 15 = 11\n\n⇒ __**5 × 8**__ - 16 + 15 = 11\n\n⇒ __**40**__ - 16 __**+ 15**__ = 11\n\n⇒ __**55 - 16 **__= 11\n\n⇒ 39 ≠ 11\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) ×, ÷\n\nAfter interchanging the sign we get the:\n\n⇒ 20 × __**4 ÷ 8 **__+ 16 - 15 = 11\n\n⇒ __**20 × 0.5**__ + 16 -15 = 11\n\n⇒ __**10 + 16**__ - 15 = 11\n\n⇒ __**26 - 15**__ = 11\n\n⇒ 11 = 11\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\n**Option 4) **+, ×\n\nAfter interchanging the sign we get the:\n\n⇒ __**20 ÷ 4**__ + 8 × 16 - 15 = 11\n\n⇒ 5 + __**8 × 16**__ - 15 = 11\n\n⇒ __**5 + 128**__ - 15 = 11\n\n⇒ __**133 - 15**__ = 11\n\n⇒ 118 ≠ 11\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 3\".**",
